          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "U5, U6, U7 — TMC2209 ... each drives a 2-phase coil output (`/A_xx+/-`, `/B_xx+/-`) to connectors H7/H8/H9"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The Nutrient-B stepper phase A+ is shorted to ground and its driver output OA1 is shorted to ground. The Nutrient-B dosing pump will not run correctly, and the TMC2209 output may be damaged when enabled.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain a clear anomaly: U7 pin 24 (OA1) and H9 pin 1 are tied to GND instead of forming the /A_NB+ motor phase, which would prevent the Nutrient-B stepper from operating and may damage the driver."
}

